{"compatibility":"minor","safety_note_md":"# SafeStan Safety Note

Compatibility: minor.

Protected data: `chosen_action`.

Generated files: `model_safe.stan`, `data_safe.json`.

Changes: reordered the model-block computations so the parameter `beta` receives its built-in prior before it is used in the likelihood expression. The local `logits` helper was inlined as `beta * utility`; this is a same-density mechanical rewrite. No data fields were added or changed.
","model_safe_stan":"// ForestDB translation: Scoring Rules
data {
  int<lower=1> A;
  int<lower=1> N;
  array[N] int<lower=1, upper=A> chosen_action;
  vector[A] utility;
}
parameters {
  real<lower=0> beta;
}
model {
  beta ~ lognormal(0, 0.75);
  chosen_action ~ categorical_logit(beta * utility);
}
generated quantities {
  simplex[A] action_prob = softmax(beta * utility);
}
","data_safe_json":"{"A":5,"N":4,"chosen_action":[2,5,1,1],"utility":[3.4640388828547177,2.100268419602335,3.470928020208542,3.5259953640276613,5.951777219790987]}","protected_variables":["chosen_action"]}
